    {
     "text": "Lambda Cart: dynamodb:PutItem · Query · DeleteItem\nLambda Create-Order: dynamodb:Query · sqs:SendMessage\nLambda Process-Order: sqs:ReceiveMessage · DeleteMessage\n· GetQueueAttributes · dynamodb:Query · BatchWriteItem\n· ec2:Create/Describe/DeleteNetworkInterface\nLas tres: logs:CreateLogGroup · CreateLogStream · PutLogEvents",
